-- Cancelling a booking does not refund what was paid. A payment is returned only when it cannot be applied.
UPDATE policies SET body = 'You can cancel a booking. Cancelling does not refund what you have paid. Session fees, deposits and remote orders are not refunded. A payment is returned only when it cannot be applied, for example when the time was already taken before the payment arrived.' WHERE slug = 'cancellations';
UPDATE policies SET body = 'The studio does not refund a booking that you cancel. A payment is returned only when it cannot be applied, for example when the time was taken before the payment arrived.' WHERE slug = 'refunds';
UPDATE policies SET body = replace(body, '- No refunds after job completion.', '- Cancelling a booking does not refund what you have paid.') WHERE slug = 'terms';
UPDATE policies SET body = replace(body, 'Rescheduling, cancellation and refund rules are set out in the booking policies, which you accept when you book. Remote orders (beats, mixing and mastering, song covers) can be cancelled for a full refund until the first finished files are delivered. After that, and after job completion, there are no refunds.', 'You can cancel a booking. Cancelling does not refund what you have paid. Rescheduling rules are set out in the booking policies, which you accept when you book.') WHERE slug = 'terms';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'You can reschedule a session once for free, up to 48 hours before it starts. Beat, mix and song-cover orders can move their start date. Cancelling does not refund what you have paid.' WHERE id = 'faq_5';
